                        "sense_id": "4484e50b-f43d-38e0-8b57-5ff7daef9752",
                        "entry_id": "04a27713-be9a-302c-b10c-1a393ceecd2b",
                        "glosses": [
                            "An uncultured, ill-mannered person."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "derogatory",
                            "obsolete"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "8ef05da1-2efc-4195-8b46-219259973acc",
                                "sense_id": "4484e50b-f43d-38e0-8b57-5ff7daef9752",
                                "text": "[…] for if a Gentleman haue in hym any humble behauour, then Roysters do cal suche one by the name of a Loute, a Clynchpope, or one that knoweth no facions […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ebee425e-e0e2-4884-a085-ca7ebf549c84",
                                "sense_id": "4484e50b-f43d-38e0-8b57-5ff7daef9752",
                                "text": "What a clenchpoope drudge is this: I can forbeare him no more."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a51815e6-4b2a-460b-a118-4eadb7fe132f",
                                "sense_id": "4484e50b-f43d-38e0-8b57-5ff7daef9752",
                                "text": "Not far of was a Loute / With neare a hansome rag, himselfe lesse handsome sole to snout, / Lesse wel-form'd, or more il-fac'st, & like Clenchpoope looke and lim,"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "dee36ec1-d500-4f30-bf1b-445e96580c1e",
                                "sense_id": "4484e50b-f43d-38e0-8b57-5ff7daef9752",
                                "text": "\"There was an unwelcome guest in our cellars last night, but the rotted clenchpoop is done in now.\""
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d63d5656-5790-467e-b5a2-b9dd4b4251cd",
                                "sense_id": "4484e50b-f43d-38e0-8b57-5ff7daef9752",
                                "text": "\"You could have any clenchpoop in these kitchens if you wanted. All you want's a fumble; it's not like you want him to marry you.\""
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
